{"sourceSha256":"7acbe5987594ec8917f83574542966d6e1225fc31f4b0e09e436a34b0a19f013","examples":[{"id":"0","name":"Counter-sample — graded icons flattened to one glyph","kind":"counter","constructed":false,"paragraphs":["A plant-list table with two icon-valued columns — Sun and H₂O. The printed page on the left uses graded symbols: a filled, a half-filled or an empty sun, and one, two or three water droplets. The parse preview on the right renders both columns as a single ☀️ and a single 💧.","That is the failure this rule exists to prevent. The icons were not dropped — they were flattened. A plant needing three droplets and one needing a single droplet come out identical, so the column still looks populated while the information it carried is gone. The columns are the whole point of the table: Sun and H₂O are the two facts a reader consults it for. The expected Markdown reads the empty sun as [sun: none]; the red outlines around the two columns are highlighting added to the figure, not part of the page."],"tables":[{"label":"Expected Markdown · printed table (left)","rows":[[{"text":"Common Name\nBotanical Name","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"Size","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"Sun","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"H2O","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1,"runs":[{"text":"H","styles":[]},{"text":"2","styles":["sub"]},{"text":"O","styles":[]}]},{"text":"Comment","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1}],[{"text":"Marigold\nTagetes hybrida","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1,"runs":[{"text":"Marigold","styles":[]},{"text":"\n","styles":[]},{"text":"Tagetes hybrida","styles":["italic"]}]},{"text":"1' x 1'","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"[sun: full]","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"[water: 1]","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"Full sun, one droplet: light, infrequent watering.","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1}],[{"text":"Larkspur\nConsolida ajacis","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1,"runs":[{"text":"Larkspur","styles":[]},{"text":"\n","styles":[]},{"text":"Consolida ajacis","styles":["italic"]}]},{"text":"2' x 1'","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"[sun: partial]","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"[water: 2]","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"Partial shade, two droplets: moderate, regular watering.","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1}],[{"text":"Fernwort\nPteris umbrosa","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1,"runs":[{"text":"Fernwort","styles":[]},{"text":"\n","styles":[]},{"text":"Pteris umbrosa","styles":["italic"]}]},{"text":"1.5' x 1'","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"[sun: none]","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"[water: 3]","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"Shade only, three droplets: keep evenly moist.","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1}],[{"text":"Coastal Sage\nSalvia litoralis","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1,"runs":[{"text":"Coastal Sage","styles":[]},{"text":"\n","styles":[]},{"text":"Salvia litoralis","styles":["italic"]}]},{"text":"3' x 2'","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"[sun: full]","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"[water: 1]","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"Drought tolerant once established.","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1}]]}],"snippets":[],"rendered":"","bad":{"tables":[{"label":"Non-conforming output","rows":[[{"text":"Common Name","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"Size","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"Sun","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"H2O","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1,"runs":[{"text":"H","styles":[]},{"text":"2","styles":["sub"]},{"text":"O","styles":[]}]},{"text":"Comment","header":true,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1}],[{"text":"Marigold","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"1' x 1'","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},{"text":"☀️","header":false,"colSpan":1,"rowSpan":1},